  advanced.fence-025,409,fenced,"def recurse(f): def r: ., (f | select(. != null) | r); r;\n\ndef while(cond; update):\n  def _while:\n    if cond then ., (update | _while) else empty end;\n  _while;\n\ndef repeat(exp):\n  def _repeat:\n    exp, _repeat;\n  _repeat;\n.","null",new,Declaration-only library is made runnable with a synthesized identity invocation; repeat is defined but not invoked because it is unbounded.,manual.advanced.fence-recursion-library
